86
00:06:17,143 --> 00:06:20,456
And the oral part asks you to
explain what you did and why.

87
00:06:20,796 --> 00:06:24,031
In a driving test, arriving at
the destination is not enough.

88
00:06:24,071 --> 00:06:28,381
If you ran a red light on the way, you
fail. That's the "safety of the path" row,

89
00:06:28,421 --> 00:06:31,388
